      "content": "everything is just... quiet now. no more bells, no more shouting. just the sound of the wind through the holes in the roof and my own stomach turning. i can hear them outside the gates. they're getting closer every night. i don't think there's anything left here for us to hold onto. it's all just going to end in screams and fire anyway.",
